request.description:
**V1 model (no classificationModelOptions).** Returns only the single most confident, specific category.

**Expected response:**
```json
{
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "/Sports/Team Sports/American Football",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ]
}
```

**What to look for:** V1 collapses the hierarchy to a single leaf node. Run Curl 2 next to see how V2 differs.

