request.description:
**V2 model** via `classificationModelOptions.v2Model.contentCategoriesVersion: "V2"`. Returns the full category hierarchy including parent nodes.

**Expected response (multiple categories with confidence scores):**
```json
{
  "categories": [
    { "name": "/Sports", "confidence": 0.97 },
    { "name": "/Sports/Team Sports", "confidence": 0.95 },
    { "name": "/Sports/Team Sports/American Football", "confidence": 0.93 },
    { "name": "/News/Sports News", "confidence": 0.72 }
  ]
}
```

**What to look for:** V2 returns ALL matching categories including parent nodes. This reveals the full hierarchy and cross-categorization (e.g., Sports News from the News branch).

